Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 15:34:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Require libarrow >=21.0 (#5100)

* require arrow 21.0

* Arrow i/o cleanup and updates

* fix typo

* cmake: make fatal

* update arrow version for pixi

* add back geotiff for pixi

* rerun CI

* rerun ci for new alpine build
---
